{"id":"4ab77c81af51a29a1495a5bfccf3831f785fe597","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234157","title":"请问下，你们用 AI 开发个人项目的时候，会开几个分支?","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"clacf","excerpt":"问与答 - @clacf - 是 feature 分支+主分支，feature 开发完毕后，合并到主分支。还是 all in 主分支？我研究来研究去，发现 all in 一个分支，也没什么坏处。有问题，直接 git r","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/clacf\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9a5af21f8dc33efc660faf5fb6b18aff?s=73&d=retro\" alt=\"clacf\" data-uid=\"411532\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/clacf\">clacf</a> · <span title=\"2026-08-13 17:02:32 +08:00\">23h 26m ago</span> · 811 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>是 feature 分支+主分支，feature 开发完毕后，合并到主分支。<br>还是 all in 主分支？</p><p>我研究来研究去，发现 all in 一个分支，也没什么坏处。有问题，直接 git reset</p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/项目\"><li></li> 项目</a><a href=\"/tag/分支\"><li></li> 分支</a></P><p><span>11 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-13 17:59:22 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971416\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/598f/e08b/540117_normal.png?m=1775783079\" alt=\"Sundayz\" data-uid=\"540117\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sundayz\">Sundayz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 17:08:23 +08:00\">23h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>主分支设置保护，所有 feat 和 fix 都新开分支</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971424\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e940/5fe0/164174_normal.png?m=1781605769\" alt=\"noqwerty\" data-uid=\"164174\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/noqwerty\">noqwerty</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 17:09:01 +08:00\">23h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>独立的大 feature 单开分支，测了没问题再合并到主分支；日常小修小补、简单功能直接主分支一把梭</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971430\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/40eaa45a823f075189ca2a4f76343678?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jackOff\" data-uid=\"593397\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jackOff\">jackOff</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 17:09:50 +08:00\">23h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是 feature 分支+主分支，ai 有低概率变成犟种的情况，这种情况下的表现是前一个提交很好，下一个提交歪到姥姥家了，而且它会和你顶嘴说这才是最好的，最恶心的是有的犟种是嘴上说你说的对，但是执行层还是默默的犟种</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971438\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/40eaa45a823f075189ca2a4f76343678?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jackOff\" data-uid=\"593397\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jackOff\">jackOff</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 17:10:47 +08:00\">23h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>而且 deepseek 还是 claude 有时候脑残居然会自己提交 git,简直无语</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971448\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/11822edc4b3c35c89dfd3b833f45b426?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"foryou2023\" data-uid=\"626307\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/foryou2023\">foryou2023</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 17:12:16 +08:00\">23h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一把梭，上线之后如果开始赚钱了，就切分支搞新的需求或修复 bug 。不赚钱就一直一把梭。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971516\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b15/0d66/525806_normal.png?m=1715683975\" alt=\"cvooc\" data-uid=\"525806\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cvooc\">cvooc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 17:21:19 +08:00\">23h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>开分支更好, 没有提交提交压力,合进 main 时直接合并提交, 然后把分支干掉</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971593\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d4b3/191c/386079_normal.png?m=1782990417\" alt=\"tianjiyao\" data-uid=\"386079\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tianjiyao\">tianjiyao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 17:33:14 +08:00\">22h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>worktree 模式啊。。最多的时候开了八个需求同时蹬。。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971610\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9a5af21f8dc33efc660faf5fb6b18aff?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"clacf\" data-uid=\"411532\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/clacf\">clacf</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 17:36:03 +08:00\">22h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/tianjiyao\">tianjiyao</a> #8 这个是不是每个需求独立目录? 如果有冲突怎么处理呢? 至今没法理解 worktree 的模式</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971634\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d4b3/191c/386079_normal.png?m=1782990417\" alt=\"tianjiyao\" data-uid=\"386079\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tianjiyao\">tianjiyao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 17:41:48 +08:00\">22h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/clacf\">clacf</a> 一般来说不太会让这几个需求修改相同的逻辑。。都一个项目里的不同模块需求吧。。如果有冲突 那就合并的时候再解，你可以理解成每个 worktree 就一个单独的 clone 的仓库。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971726\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/af5e/0385/651753_normal.png?m=1695968108\" alt=\"sleek7671\" data-uid=\"651753\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sleek7671\">sleek7671</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 17:59:22 +08:00\">22h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>2-3 个，worktree 偶尔也用，但是以前还真没了解过 worktree ，大一点的需求变动会开分支</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"clacf · 23h 26m ago · 811 views 是 feature 分支+主分支，feature 开发完毕后，合并到主分支。还是 all in 主分支？我研究来研究去，发现 all in 一个分支，也没什么坏处。有问题，直接 git reset AI 项目 分支11 replies • 2026-08-13 17:59:22 +08:00 2 Sundayz 23h 20m ago 主分支设置保护，所有 feat 和 fix 都新开分支 3 noqwerty 23h 19m ago 独立的大 feature 单开分支，测了没问题再合并到主分支；日常小修小补、简单功能直接主分支一把梭 4 jackOff 23h 18m ago 是 feature 分支+主分支，ai 有低概率变成犟种的情况，这种情况下的表现是前一个提交很好，下一个提交歪到姥姥家了，而且它会和你顶嘴说这才是最好的，最恶心的是有的犟种是嘴上说你说的对，但是执行层还是默默的犟种 5 jackOff 23h 17m ago 而且 deepseek 还是 claude 有时候脑残居然会自己提交 git,简直无语 6 foryou2023 23h 16m ago 一把梭，上线之后如果开始赚钱了，就切分支搞新的需求或修复 bug 。不赚钱就一直一把梭。 7 cvooc 23h 7m ago 开分支更好, 没有提交提交压力,合进 main 时直接合并提交, 然后把分支干掉 8 tianjiyao 22h 55m ago worktree 模式啊。。最多的时候开了八个需求同时蹬。。。 9 clacf OP 22h 52m ago @tianjiyao #8 这个是不是每个需求独立目录? 如果有冲突怎么处理呢? 至今没法理解 worktree 的模式 10 tianjiyao 22h 46m ago @clacf 一般来说不太会让这几个需求修改相同的逻辑。。都一个项目里的不同模块需求吧。。如果有冲突 那就合并的时候再解，你可以理解成每个 worktree 就一个单独的 clone 的仓库。。 11 sleek7671 22h 29m ago 2-3 个，worktree 偶尔也用，但是以前还真没了解过 worktree ，大一点的需求变动会开分支","fetched_at":"2026-08-14T08:32:30.294Z","ok":true}